# Protected paths: a human maintainer must review these; they are never auto-merged.
# Bot accounts must never appear here, directly or via a team.
# Code-owner reviews are not yet required (single maintainer, see docs/adr/0013-contribution-model.md).
# Until then this file routes review; it becomes enforced when MAINTAINERS.md lists two humans.
# Binary files and added `unsafe` can't be expressed here; the `checks` gate holds them.
# Matching here is case-sensitive; the `checks` gate matches names case-insensitively.

# Security-sensitive crates (DESIGN 6.3) and the wire format
/crates/zoopa-crypto/          @nissifield
/crates/zoopa-spa/             @nissifield
/crates/zoopa-tunnel/          @nissifield
/crates/zoopa-policy/          @nissifield
